# Default, free: get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Keep billing OFF on the underlying Cloud project — that's what keeps a
# leaked key from ever costing money, it just gets rate-limited instead.
# (If you ever want to test a paid Gemini model too, do it from a SEPARATE
# Cloud project — enabling billing removes the free tier for the whole
# project it's enabled on, not just the paid calls.)
# Also restrict the key (API restrictions -> Generative Language API only).
# Free tier covers Flash/Flash-Lite models only (Pro is paid-only); Google
# may use free-tier inputs/outputs to improve their models, so don't run
# anything sensitive through it.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional upgrade: if set, this takes priority over GEMINI_API_KEY.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
